# Never commit real chat data (privacy-first per src/chats/code/CLAUDE.md)
# Globs, not exact names, so re-exports (_chatv2.txt, chatv2.json, ...) stay
# covered too. sample_chat.json is exempt — it's the safe placeholder.
src/chats/code/_chat*.txt
src/chats/code/chat*.json
src/chats/code/analysis*.json

# Global fallbacks for chat files
_chat*.txt
chat*.json
analysis*.json
